      "evidence_id": "EV_025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, look for one with 10,000 lux. And keep taking the sertraline. I'd like to arrange a blood test, to check your thyroid and vitamin D, as these can add to low mood.",
